1
00:00:08,851 --> 00:00:10,886
Ab ek poora din dekhte hain.

2
00:00:10,926 --> 00:00:16,666
Subah owner login karta hai aur dashboard par
kal ki bikri, bakaaya, low stock

3
00:00:16,706 --> 00:00:18,296
aur expiry dekhta hai.

4
00:00:19,071 --> 00:00:22,695
Stock mein low stock aur expiry check hoti hai.

5
00:00:22,735 --> 00:00:24,254
Montidem LC kam hai.

6
00:00:26,234 --> 00:00:29,384
Gyaarah baje Birsa Healthcare se maal aata hai.

7
00:00:29,424 --> 00:00:34,679
Purchase bill type karke save karte hi GRN banta
hai aur stock badh jaata hai.

8
00:00:39,269 --> 00:00:41,525
Dopahar mein customer aata hai.

9
00:00:41,565 --> 00:00:48,042
Staff search box mein medicine khojta hai,
customer ka mobile daalta hai, UPI chunta hai

10
00:00:48,082 --> 00:00:49,967
aur F9 se bill banata hai.

11
00:00:52,965 --> 00:00:58,308
Invoice print hota hai, ya WhatsApp juda ho to
customer ko bheja jaata hai.

12
00:00:58,348 --> 00:01:00,103
Stock apne-aap ghat gaya.

13
00:01:00,866 --> 00:01:04,197
Shaam ko ek customer sealed strip waapas karta
hai.

14
00:01:04,237 --> 00:01:08,098
Bills screen se bill dhoondhkar return aur
refund hota hai.

15
00:01:11,189 --> 00:01:16,852
Din ke ant mein owner day-end dekhta hai, phir
Books mein profit and loss se munaafa

16
00:01:16,892 --> 00:01:20,519
aur kharch, aur reports apne accountant ko
bhejta hai.

17
00:01:20,559 --> 00:01:23,099
Yahi hai Medoro ke saath ek poora din.
